OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, bright start across the
OL,6,Fregion, with any mist patches clearing
OL,7,Fquickly. Cloud builds at times through
OL,8,Fthe day but remaining dry with good
OL,9,Fsunny spells. Warm in the sun by mid
OL,10,Fafternoon. Light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FFine and partly cloudy
OL,13,Finitially. Cloud breaks to give a
OL,14,Fclear night with mist and fog patches
OL,15,Fdeveloping. Another cool night likely,
OL,16,Fparticularly in rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
