OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FWidely clear and dry to start
OL,6,Facross the region, cloud slowly builds
OL,7,Fbut a very warm day in prospect.
OL,8,FTurning cloudier overnight with some
OL,9,Flight rain.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDrier
OL,12,Fand brighter through Saturday. Mostly
OL,13,Ffine but breezy on Sunday, with light
OL,14,Frain arriving during the evening. A
OL,15,Ffurther fine day on Monday.
OL,16,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
